1. [LOCAL] Define the target tech companies and set the monitoring frequency. | out watchlist
2. [READ] Search for recent news articles mentioning the target tech companies. | out news_articles | api D | args {"q": "$step1.watchlist", "pageSize": "10", "pageNumber": "1", "autoCorrect": "true"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved news articles to keep only those within the desired date range. | out filtered_articles
4. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the company mentions in the filtered news articles. | out sentiment_results | api D | args {"text": "$step3.filtered_articles.text"}
5. [READ] Fetch the current stock quote for each company mentioned in the news articles. | out stock_quotes | api E | args {"symbol": "$step1.watchlist"}
6. [LOCAL] Calculate the percentage change in stock price for each company based on the fetched quotes. | out price_changes
7. [LOCAL] Combine the sentiment analysis results and price changes to rank the companies. | out ranked_companies
8. [LOCAL] Format the ranked companies into a single spreadsheet row. | out summary_row
9. [WRITE] Append the formatted summary row to the daily report spreadsheet. | out report_status | api E | args {"data": "$step8.summary_row"}
10. [LOCAL] Schedule the daily report generation task to run at the specified interval. | out schedule_status

1. [LOCAL] Define list of destination cities and travel dates. | out trip
2. [READ] Search flight status for each route. | out flight_status | api B | args {"FlightNumber": "$step1.trip.routes", "AirlineCode": "$step1.trip.airlines"}
3. [READ] Retrieve current weather conditions for destination cities. | out weather | api B | args {"city": "$step1.trip.cities"}
4. [PROCESS] Convert ticket prices between currencies. | out prices_local | api A | args {"amount": "$step1.trip.prices", "from": "USD", "to": "$user.home_currency"}
5. [LOCAL] Compare flight delays with weather forecasts. | out delays
6. [LOCAL] Compose trip summary message. | out summary
7. [WRITE] Send push notification with trip summary. | out push_status | api A | args {"t": "My next trip", "m": "$step6.summary", "d": "$user.device_id", "k": "$user.pushsafer_key"}
8. [LOCAL] Flag tickets above budget threshold. | out budget_check
9. [LOCAL] Note open seats per flight. | out seats
10. [LOCAL] Plan backup flights for delays. | out backups

1. [LOCAL] Define the search criteria for major public events. | out search_criteria
2. [READ] Search for upcoming public events in the specified region. | out events | api A | args {"apiKey": "$user.events_api_key", "keyword": "$step1.search_criteria.event_type", "startDateTime": "$user.start_date", "endDateTime": "$user.end_date"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the list of events to keep only those within the specified date range. | out filtered_events
4. [READ] Look up the coordinates of each event venue. | out coords | api D | args {"id": "$step3.filtered_events.venue_id", "region": "$user.region_code", "country": "$user.country_code", "consumerKey": "$user.consumer_key", "consumerSecret": "$user.consumer_secret"}
5. [READ] Retrieve the weather forecast for the town where each event is located. | out forecast | api D | args {"city": "$step4.coords.town"}
6. [LOCAL] Extract the event name and description from the event data. | out event_details
7. [LOCAL] Format the extracted event details into task fields. | out task_fields
8. [WRITE] Create a new task in the project management tool. | out created_task | api B | args {"title": "$step7.task_fields.title", "description": "$step7.task_fields.description"}
9. [LOCAL] Check if the created task is already tracked. | out is_tracked
10. [LOCAL] Update the frequency of the monitoring schedule. | out schedule

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of monitored assets. | out assets
2. [READ] List recent news articles about each asset. | out news_articles | api B | args {"q": "$step1.assets", "language": "en"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the news articles by relevance score. | out filtered_articles
4. [READ] Extract text content from the filtered news article. | out article_content | api E | args {"url": "$step3.filtered_articles.url"}
5. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the extracted article text. | out sentiment_result | api E | args {"text": "$step4.article_content.text"}
6. [PROCESS] Summarize the text content into a brief report. | out summary_report | api B | args {"text": "$step4.article_content.text"}
7. [LOCAL] Format the summary report as an email message body. | out email_body
8. [WRITE] Send the formatted email message to the recipient address. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.email_address", "subject": "Asset news summary", "body": "$step7.email_body"}
9. [LOCAL] Set the daily schedule for monitoring. | out schedule
10. [LOCAL] Track the frequency of alerts sent. | out alert_history

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of target news sources based on the company name. | out news_sources
2. [READ] Search for recent news articles related to the company. | out news_articles | api E | args {"q": "$step1.news_sources", "pageSize": "50", "pageNumber": "1", "autoCorrect": "true"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved news articles to keep only those mentioning the company. | out filtered_articles
4. [PROCESS] Summarize the content of the filtered articles. | out article_summaries | api D | args {"text": "$step3.filtered_articles.text"}
5. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the article content. | out sentiment_scores | api D | args {"text": "$step3.filtered_articles.text"}
6. [LOCAL] Compare the sentiment score against a predefined threshold. | out is_positive
7. [LOCAL] Extract relevant company contact information from the article. | out contact_info
8. [LOCAL] Format the monitoring result into a lead record. | out lead_record
9. [WRITE] Create a new contact record in the CRM. | out crm_result | api A | args {"Content-Type": "application/json", "name": "$step8.lead_record.name", "email": "$step8.lead_record.email"}
10. [LOCAL] Update the monitoring history with the newly created lead record. | out history_update

1. [LOCAL] Read chart genre and follower count. | out chart
2. [READ] Fetch top trending tracks from music chart. | out tracks | api A | args {"genre": "$step1.chart.genre", "kind": "tracks"}
3. [READ] Search lyrics for each song. | out lyrics | api A | args {"query": "$step2.tracks.title"}
4. [PROCESS] Summarize lyrical themes found in songs. | out themes | api A | args {"lyrics": "$step3.lyrics.text"}
5. [LOCAL] Write weekly music update post. | out post
6. [WRITE] Publish music update on social media. | out post_status | api B | args {"music": "$step5.post"}
7. [LOCAL] Pick standout track of the week. | out standout
8. [LOCAL] Note songs with explicit lyrics. | out explicit
9. [LOCAL] Track follower growth from updates. | out growth
10. [LOCAL] Plan next week's playlist ideas. | out playlist

1. [LOCAL] Load movie title list. | out movies
2. [READ] Search movies by title. | out movie_data | api A | args {"primaryTitle": "$step1.movies.title"}
3. [LOCAL] Drop movies already watched. | out eligible_movies
4. [READ] Retrieve movie rating for each. | out ratings | api A | args {"minimum_rating": "7", "title": "$step3.eligible_movies.title"}
5. [LOCAL] Select highest rated movie. | out highest_rated
6. [WRITE] Create calendar event for movie screening. | out screening_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Movie night", "start": "2026-05-15T19:00:00", "end": "2026-05-15T21:00:00", "location": "Home cinema"}
7. [LOCAL] Build trailer link from movie title. | out trailer_url
8. [PROCESS] Generate short link for trailer. | out short_url | api C | args {"destination": "$step7.trailer_url"}
9. [LOCAL] Compose movie pick text. | out pick_text
10. [WRITE] Send movie pick to team by SMS. | out sms_status | api E | args {"to": "$step1.movies.team", "message": "$step9.pick_text"}

1. [LOCAL] Load monthly donations and donors. | out donations
2. [PROCESS] Convert donations between currencies. | out usd_donations | api D | args {"amount": "$step1.donations.amount", "from": "$step1.donations.currency", "to": "USD"}
3. [PROCESS] Validate donor email address. | out valid | api D | args {"email": "$step1.donations.email"}
4. [LOCAL] Build donation receipt per donor. | out receipts
5. [PROCESS] Convert donation receipts into PDF. | out receipts_pdf | api A | args {"name": "donation_receipt_$step4.receipts.id.pdf", "content": "$step4.receipts"}
6. [WRITE] Upload receipt file to cloud storage. | out receipt_url | api A | args {"your-file": "$step5.receipts_pdf"}
7. [WRITE] Send receipt email to donor. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$step3.valid.email", "subject": "Your donation receipt", "body": "$step6.receipt_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Add new donors to newsletter list. | out newsletter_list
9. [LOCAL] Count gifts per donor this month. | out gift_counts
10. [LOCAL] Compose monthly donor report. | out report

1. [LOCAL] Read campaign details and page url. | out campaign
2. [PROCESS] Generate campaign illustration from prompt. | out image | api C | args {"prompt": "$step1.campaign.details", "style": "illustration", "ratio": "1:1", "steps": "25", "cfg": "7", "sampler": "euler", "controlNet": "none"}
3. [PROCESS] Generate short link for donation page. | out short_url | api B | args {"destination": "$step1.campaign.url"}
4. [PROCESS] Generate QR code for donation page. | out qr | api C | args {"link": "$step3.short_url"}
5. [LOCAL] Write campaign post with illustration. | out post
6. [WRITE] Publish campaign post on social media. | out post_status | api E | args {"text": "$step5.post", "title": "Give today"}
7. [WRITE] Send campaign email to supporter list. | out email_status | api A | args {"to": "$user.supporter_list", "subject": "Giving day", "body": "$step5.post"}
8. [WRITE] Send campaign message by SMS to volunteers. | out sms_status | api D | args {"to": "$user.volunteer_list", "message": "$step5.post"}
9. [LOCAL] Track pledges per hour. | out pledges
10. [LOCAL] Plan thank-you notes for donors. | out thanks

1. [LOCAL] Read brand name and monitoring keywords. | out config
2. [READ] Search recent news articles by keyword. | out articles | api C | args {"apiKey": "$user.api_key", "query": "$step1.config.brand"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter articles containing brand name. | out brand_articles
4. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of each article mention. | out sentiment | api E | args {"text": "$step3.brand_articles.text"}
5. [LOCAL] Select negative mentions from results. | out negative_mentions
6. [WRITE] Create task for negative mention. | out tasks | api E | args {"title": "Negative mention", "description": "$step5.negative_mentions"}
7. [LOCAL] Compose mention list message. | out mention_msg
8. [WRITE] Send mention list to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step7.mention_msg", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
9. [LOCAL] Select most positive mention text. | out best_mention
10. [LOCAL] Compose weekly thank-you post draft. | out thank_you_draft
11. [WRITE] Publish thank-you post on social media. | out post_status | api C | args {"title": "Thank you", "body": "$step10.thank_you_draft", "url": "$user.cafe_url"}

1. [LOCAL] Load open mic performers and songs. | out night
2. [READ] Retrieve lyrics for each requested song. | out lyrics | api A | args {"accessToken": "$user.access_token", "song": "$step1.night.songs"}
3. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of song lyrics. | out tone | api C | args {"text": "$step2.lyrics"}
4. [LOCAL] Flag songs with strong negative or explicit tone. | out flagged
5. [WRITE] Create calendar event for open mic night. | out night_event | api B | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Open mic night", "start": "$user.start_time", "end": "$user.end_time", "location": "$user.venue"}
6. [WRITE] Send slot message by SMS to performers. | out sms_status | api E | args {"phone": "$step1.night.performers.phone", "message": "$step4.flagged", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
7. [LOCAL] Build running order from slots. | out order
8. [WRITE] Send running order message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step7.order", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
9. [LOCAL] Set time limit per performer. | out limits
10. [LOCAL] Arrange sound check times. | out sound_checks

1. [LOCAL] Load donated auction items. | out items
2. [PROCESS] Generate item illustration from prompt. | out illustrations | api C | args {"prompt": "$step1.items.descriptions"}
3. [LOCAL] Write short auction description. | out description
4. [LOCAL] Lay out auction catalog page. | out catalog_html
5. [PROCESS] Convert auction catalog into PDF. | out catalog_pdf | api D | args {"name": "auction_catalog", "folder": "$user.cloud_folder", "content": "$step4.catalog_html"}
6. [WRITE] Upload auction catalog to cloud storage. | out catalog_url | api B | args {"file": "$step5.catalog_pdf"}
7. [PROCESS] Generate short link for auction catalog. | out short_url | api B | args {"url": "$step6.catalog_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Write auction announcement post. | out post
9. [WRITE] Publish auction announcement on social media. | out post_status | api D | args {"id": "$user.post_id", "secret_key": "$user.secret_key"}
10. [WRITE] Send catalog link email to bidders. | out email_status | api A | args {"to": "$step1.items.bidders", "subject": "Charity auction catalog", "body": "$step7.short_url"}

1. [LOCAL] Load vaccination records and owner preferences. | out clinic
2. [LOCAL] Select pets due for booster soon. | out due
3. [LOCAL] Compose vaccination reminder per owner. | out reminders
4. [PROCESS] Translate reminder into owner language. | out reminders_es | api C | args {"text": "$step3.reminders", "lang": "es"}
5. [WRITE] Send vaccination reminder by SMS. | out sms_status | api E | args {"to": "$step2.due.owner_phone", "message": "$step4.reminders_es"}
6. [LOCAL] Select owners who replied yes. | out confirmed
7. [WRITE] Book appointment for booster. | out appointments | api E | args {"date": "$user.appointment_date", "patient": "$step6.confirmed.pet_name", "clinic": "$user.clinic_name"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose weekly booster list. | out list_text
9. [WRITE] Send booster list email to vets. | out email_status | api A | args {"page_size": "10", "page": "1"}
10. [LOCAL] Flag pets overdue on rabies. | out rabies

1. [LOCAL] Load followed club list. | out clubs
2. [READ] Retrieve upcoming fixtures for each team. | out fixtures | api E | args {"id": "$step1.clubs.id"}
3. [READ] Retrieve weather forecast for each match city. | out forecast | api B | args {"city": "$step2.fixtures.city"}
4. [LOCAL] Flag games likely to be rained out. | out wet_games
5. [LOCAL] Write matchweek preview page. | out preview_html
6. [PROCESS] Convert matchweek preview into PDF. | out preview_pdf | api E | args {"html": "$step5.preview_html"}
7. [WRITE] Upload preview to cloud storage. | out preview_url | api A | args {"your-file": "$step6.preview_pdf"}
8. [WRITE] Send preview link message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step7.preview_url", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
9. [LOCAL] Pick starting lineups per team. | out lineups
10. [LOCAL] Note transfer deadline day options. | out deadline

1. [LOCAL] Read garden town and volunteers. | out garden
2. [READ] Retrieve tomorrow's forecast for garden town. | out forecast | api C | args {"location": "$step1.garden.town", "timesteps": "today"}
3. [READ] Retrieve sunrise time for garden. | out sun_times | api B | args {"city": "$step1.garden.town", "date": "$user.tomorrow"}
4. [LOCAL] Set watering slot from forecast. | out slot
5. [WRITE] Create calendar event for watering slot. | out slot_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Watering", "start": "$step4.slot.start", "end": "$step4.slot.end", "location": "$user.garden"}
6. [LOCAL] Select volunteer on duty tonight. | out volunteer
7. [WRITE] Send watering slot to volunteer by SMS. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$step6.volunteer.phone", "text": "$step4.slot"}
8. [WRITE] Send watering note message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step4.slot", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
9. [LOCAL] Add watering slot to weekly record. | out record
10. [LOCAL] Track watering hours per week. | out hours

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of target ingredients. | out ingredients
2. [READ] Search recent news articles for ingredient mentions. | out news_articles | api D | args {"query": "$step1.ingredients"}
3. [READ] Extract text content from news article. | out article_content | api D | args {"url": "$step2.news_articles.url"}
4. [LOCAL] Clean and normalize extracted text. | out cleaned_text
5. [LOCAL] Identify trending dishes from news. | out trending_dishes
6. [READ] Search latest market price for each item. | out market_prices | api E | args {"symbol": "$step1.ingredients"}
7. [LOCAL] Aggregate price data into weekly table. | out price_table
8. [LOCAL] Compare price trend with historical data. | out trend_analysis
9. [LOCAL] Compose weekly food trends digest. | out digest
10. [WRITE] Send email message to recipient address. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.email", "subject": "Weekly food trends", "body": "$step9.digest"}

1. [LOCAL] Define the scientific field and keywords for the search. | out search_criteria
2. [READ] Search for recent news articles related to the defined field. | out news_articles | api A | args {"q": "$step1.search_criteria"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter the retrieved news articles based on relevance. | out filtered_articles
4. [READ] Extract the full text content from the URLs of the filtered articles. | out article_content | api C | args {"url": "$step3.filtered_articles.url"}
5. [PROCESS] Generate a concise summary of the extracted article content. | out summary | api B | args {"text": "$step4.article_content.text"}
6. [LOCAL] Evaluate if the generated summary represents a new scientific discovery. | out validated_summary
7. [READ] Search for research papers related to the defined field. | out research_papers | api D | args {"apiKey": "$user.api_key", "query": "$step1.search_criteria"}
8. [LOCAL] Extract the abstract text from the retrieved research papers. | out paper_abstracts
9. [LOCAL] Compare the summary against the paper abstracts to validate the discovery. | out validation_result
10. [LOCAL] Select the most significant discovery from the validated results. | out selected_discovery
11. [LOCAL] Format the selected discovery details for the social media post. | out post_body
12. [WRITE] Post the formatted discovery message to the social media feed. | out post_status | api A | args {"title": "New scientific discovery", "body": "$step11.post_body", "url": "$user.blog_url"}

1. [LOCAL] Load open shipments with promised dates. | out shipments
2. [READ] Retrieve tracking status for each shipment. | out tracking | api B | args {"trackingNumber": "$step1.shipments.tracking_number", "slug": "$user.carrier_slug", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
3. [LOCAL] Flag shipments past promised date. | out late_shipments
4. [LOCAL] Compose update text per customer. | out update_texts
5. [WRITE] Send update text to customer during business hours. | out sms_status | api A | args {"to": "$step3.late_shipments.phone", "message": "$step4.update_texts"}
6. [WRITE] Create support ticket for each delay. | out tickets | api A | args {"subject": "Delayed shipment", "description": "$step3.late_shipments", "apiKey": "$user.api_key", "domain": "$user.helpdesk_domain"}
7. [LOCAL] Compose daily delay summary. | out summary
8. [WRITE] Send delay summary email to manager. | out email_status | api C | args {"accessToken": "$user.access_token", "to": "$user.manager_email", "subject": "Delayed shipments today", "content": "$step7.summary"}
9. [LOCAL] Count delays per carrier. | out counts
10. [LOCAL] Note packages needing expedited shipping. | out expedite

1. [LOCAL] Load weekly specials descriptions. | out specials
2. [PROCESS] Calculate nutrition content of each dish. | out nutrition | api A | args {"id": "$step1.specials.dishes"}
3. [PROCESS] Generate dish illustration from prompt. | out images | api E | args {"prompt": "$step1.specials.dishes"}
4. [LOCAL] Build specials menu page. | out menu_html
5. [WRITE] Upload specials menu to cloud storage. | out menu_url | api B | args {"file": "$step4.menu_html"}
6. [WRITE] Publish specials post on social media. | out post_status | api A | args {"id": "$user.page_id", "secret_key": "$user.api_key"}
7. [WRITE] Send specials link by SMS. | out sms_status | api E | args {"to": "$step1.specials.vips", "message": "$step5.menu_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Plan prep schedule for specials. | out prep
9. [LOCAL] Note allergens per dish. | out allergens
10. [LOCAL] Set prices for specials. | out prices

1. [LOCAL] Load new lab report images. | out reports
2. [PROCESS] Extract text from lab report image with OCR. | out report_text | api B | args {"image": "$step1.reports.images"}
3. [LOCAL] Pull out test results and ranges. | out results
4. [LOCAL] Flag tests outside normal range. | out flags
5. [PROCESS] Summarize test results for doctor. | out summary | api D | args {"text": "$step2.report_text"}
6. [LOCAL] Pick follow-up appointment slot. | out slot
7. [WRITE] Book follow-up appointment for patient. | out appointment | api A | args {"clinicName": "$step1.reports.clinic", "date": "$step6.slot"}
8. [LOCAL] Write patient note in their language. | out note
9. [WRITE] Send patient note email. | out email_status | api E | args {"Authorization": "$user.smtp_token", "content-type": "application/json", "content": "$step8.note"}
10. [LOCAL] Flag urgent conditions needing referral. | out referrals

1. [LOCAL] Load new interface string table. | out strings
2. [PROCESS] Correct grammar of English source. | out source_clean | api A | args {"text": "$step1.strings.source"}
3. [PROCESS] Translate strings into target languages. | out translations | api C | args {"q": "$step2.source_clean", "target": "$user.languages"}
4. [LOCAL] Keep placeholders untranslated. | out ready
5. [LOCAL] Flag translations over UI width. | out too_long
6. [WRITE] Upload locale files to cloud storage. | out files_url | api A | args {"your-file": "$step4.ready"}
7. [WRITE] Create review task for translators. | out tasks | api E | args {"title": "Translate strings", "description": "$step5.too_long"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose developer note with flags. | out note
9. [WRITE] Send translation message to team chat group. | out chat_status | api E | args {"chat_id": "$user.chat_id", "text": "$step8.note"}
10. [LOCAL] Count strings per language. | out counts

1. [LOCAL] Load team updates from yesterday. | out updates
2. [LOCAL] Split updates into done, doing and blocked. | out triage
3. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of each update. | out tone | api E | args {"text": "$step1.updates.text"}
4. [LOCAL] Compose daily standup summary. | out summary
5. [WRITE] Send standup summary to team chat group. | out chat_status | api D | args {"m": "$step4.summary", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
6. [LOCAL] Select blockers from today's list. | out blockers
7. [WRITE] Create task for each blocker. | out tasks | api C | args {"WorkflowSid": "$user.workflow_sid", "Attributes": "$step6.blockers", "WorkspaceSid": "$user.workspace_sid"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose weekly standup digest. | out digest
9. [WRITE] Send weekly digest email to me. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.email", "subject": "Weekly standup digest", "body": "$step8.digest"}
10. [LOCAL] Count stories per team member. | out stories

1. [LOCAL] Load early-bird course buyers. | out buyers
2. [WRITE] Create user account for early-birds. | out accounts | api A | args {"name": "$step1.buyers.name", "email": "$step1.buyers.email"}
3. [WRITE] Add early-birds to course mailing list. | out members | api D | args {"address": "$step1.buyers.email", "name": "$step1.buyers.name", "subscribed": "yes", "upsert": "yes", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
4. [LOCAL] Compose login details email. | out login_email
5. [WRITE] Send login details email to buyers. | out email_status | api B | args {"recipient": "$step1.buyers.email", "subject": "Your watercolor course login", "text": "$step4.login_email", "smtpUser": "$user.smtp_login", "smtpPass": "$user.smtp_password", "smtpURL": "$user.smtp_url"}
6. [WRITE] Create calendar event for live session. | out session_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Watercolor live session", "start": "$user.session_start", "end": "$user.session_end", "location": "$user.video_link"}
7. [PROCESS] Generate short link for course page. | out short_url | api B | args {"url": "$user.course_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Write launch announcement post. | out post
9. [WRITE] Post launch announcement on social media. | out post_status | api D | args {"activity": "$step8.post", "feedOwnerId": "$user.feed_owner_id", "feedOwnerType": "user", "feedTargetId": "$user.feed_target_id", "apiKey": "$user.api_key", "feedTargetType": "user"}
10. [LOCAL] Plan weekly lesson topics. | out lessons

1. [LOCAL] Load items for yard sale. | out items
2. [LOCAL] Write description per item. | out descriptions
3. [PROCESS] Correct grammar of item descriptions. | out descriptions_clean | api A | args {"text": "$step2.descriptions"}
4. [LOCAL] Price items by value. | out prices
5. [LOCAL] Build yard sale flyer page. | out flyer_html
6. [PROCESS] Generate QR code for yard sale. | out qr | api A | args {"url": "$step5.flyer_html"}
7. [PROCESS] Generate flyer illustration from prompt. | out flyer_image | api C | args {"prompt": "$step5.flyer_html"}
8. [WRITE] Publish yard sale post on social media. | out post_status | api A | args {"id": "$user.post_id", "secret_key": "$user.api_key"}
9. [WRITE] Send yard sale flyer by SMS. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$step1.items.neighbours", "message": "$step6.qr", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
10. [LOCAL] Arrange items in rows. | out layout

1. [LOCAL] Read concert list and trip dates. | out trip
2. [READ] Search upcoming concerts in city. | out concerts | api A | args {"name": "Montreal", "minDate": "$step1.trip.start", "maxDate": "$step1.trip.end"}
3. [LOCAL] Keep concerts on trip dates. | out matches
4. [READ] Retrieve forecast for show nights. | out forecast | api A | args {"apiKey": "$user.darksky_api_key", "coordinates": "$step3.matches.lat_lon"}
5. [PROCESS] Convert ticket prices between currencies. | out prices_eur | api A | args {"amount": "$step3.matches.price", "from": "CAD", "to": "EUR"}
